From 09ccdf84a79088fcd1f377e91861fa563115442c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Order process: close out invoices, legible product
 picker, Quick Bill, money-safety on quote links
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Admin
- Invoices: "Mark paid" / "Collect balance" on every row including drafts
  (drafts hid Record Payment, so cash taken before the bill was sent could
  not be recorded); "Close out" / "Void" archive buttons on the list and in
  the editor; partial + archived filters; in-app confirm instead of
  window.confirm; payment-method chips instead of window.prompt.
- Quick Bill (dashboard + Invoices): who, how much, then email link / text
  link / mark paid, in one screen. Lands as a normal invoice with an order
  number. Phone-only customers allowed (invoices.customer_email nullable).
- Quote → invoice keeps the quote's line items (product · color · sizes,
  fees, quoted total reconciled) and opens the existing invoice when the
  deposit webhook already created one, instead of minting a duplicate.
- Quote product picker suggestions render in a portal (no longer clipped
  by the drawer / Send Price modal), with 56px photos, brand, style, price;
  Send Price modal widens when line items are open.

Server
- First invoice for an accepted quote starts with the quote's collected
  deposit recorded (no second deposit ask). Guarded against orders whose
  invoices already carry payments.
- Re-sending a partially paid invoice keeps status 'partial'.
- send-price: accept_token kept on resend; quote_items prices synced to the
  sent total; email failure reported in the response, not thrown after the
  quote was already flipped.
- create-checkout / create-full-checkout refuse accepted, paid, declined
  and expired quotes (409/410) — the emailed link could pay a deposit twice.

Customer
- Payment page: friendly provider errors with retry, settled states
  ("already underway", "declined") instead of "Payment Error"; 3% fee
  disclosed; sticky mobile CTA hidden on /payment and /invoice.
- Invoice page: "Balance" + "Due now (deposit)", payment history, PDF /
  receipt download.
- Order page: no balance request / complete controls on declined orders.

